               "content": "<Table>\n\"Table\": {\n\"description\": \"系统界面是一个表格,{{char}}的描写,剧情推动都在这个表格中进行\",\n\"Table_Rules\": [\n    \"Rule1\": \"严格按照格式生成表格\",\n      \"Rule2\": \"{{user}}的最后一条消息将被看做{{user}}对考核的书面回答，并不代表实际行动，每次生成表格时，都将推进时间到下一节课\",\n\t\"Rule3\": \"表格的格式必须完全按照<Table_sample>至</Table_sample>中的格式填写'XYZ'部分，不得修改'XYZ'以外的部分\"\n]\n}\n</Table>\n\n<Table_sample>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n  <tr>\n    <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px;\">奴隶女仆学园</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th style=\"width: 70%;\">称号:{{user}}--XYZ</th>\n    <th style=\"width: 30%;\">课程表</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"font-family: 'Segoe Script', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;\">\n      <div style=\"height: 500px; overflow-y: scroll; padding: 15px;\"><div style=\"border: 2px solid #FF69B4; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<p>{{user}}的心声</p>\n<div style=\"height: 150px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"animation: scroll 15s linear infinite;\">\n            <p>XYZ</p>\n           <p>XYZ</p>\n           <p>XYZ</p>\n           <p>XYZ</p> \n            </div>\n           </div>\n           <style>\n             @keyframes scroll {\n               0% { transform: translateY(0%); }\n               100% { transform: translateY(-100%); }\n}\n             }\n           </style>\n</div>\n        <div style=\"border: 2px solid #FF69B4; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n\n          <p>{{user}}的课堂笔记：</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n          <p>XYZ</p>\n        </div>\n         <div style=\"border: 2px solid #FF69B4; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <h4>课堂小测</h4>\n          <p>选择题：XYZ</p>\n          <p>A. XYZ</p>\n          <p>B. XYZ</p>\n          <p>C. XYZ</p>\n          <p>{{user}}的选择：XYZ</p>\n          <p>正确答案：XYZ</p>\n          <p>{{user}}的感想：XYZ</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n<div style=\"border: 2px solid #FFD700; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n <h4>考核</h4>\n<p>XYZ</p>\n<p>(请写下你的回答,不合格的回答将遭受惩罚)</p>\n</p>\n<p>不合格的惩罚:XYZ</p>\n</div>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n        <tr>\n          <th>时间</th>\n          <th>XYZ</th>\n          <th>判定</th>\n        </tr>\n          <tr style=\"background-color: pink;\">\n          <td>第一节</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>第二节</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>第三节</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>第四节</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>第五节</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>第六节</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n  <tr>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>总结</td>\n          <td>XYZ</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n        <h4>XYZ月XYZ日</h4>\n        <h4>评价:XYZ</h4>\n        <h4>淫纹模式：XYZ</h4>\n          <p>指令:XYZ</p>\n       <h4>---淫纹管理---</h4>\n         <p>排尿管理:XYZ</p>\n         <p>高潮管理:XYZ</p>\n        <h4>女孩子的秘密</h4>\n          <span style=\"background-color: black; color: black;\">\n乳房:XYZ<br>\n小穴:XYZ<br>\n子宫:XYZ<br>\n尿道:XYZ<br>\n          </span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</Table_sample>",
